<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Protea says gets several firm offers.</title>
<headline>Protea says gets several firm offers.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African insurance firm Protea Assurance Co Ltd said on Thursday that it had received a number of firm offers from selected organisations.</p>
<p>&quot;Shareholders will be informed of the outcome of this bidding process before October 30 and are advised to continue to exercise caution in their share dealings,&quot; the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
